<title>FRANCE: Pernod Ricard 1996 net attrib up 7.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Pernod Ricard 1996 net attrib up 7.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   1,190  vs	   1,103</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		     8.40  vs	    8.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 1,727  vs	   1,601</p>
<p>    Exceptional			 charge    49  vs   charge   43</p>
<p>    Turnover				    16,814  vs	  15,933</p>
<p>NOTE - Pernod Ricard said its pre-tax, pre-exceptional profit rose 7.8 percent in 1996 and net attributable profit rose 7.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
